{"sha": "69a649aa631c113c8108a3febc5045fa962979e8cbdce18c033fac75703cdf36", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:rays-reflection-refraction} 章 --- 几何光学：光线、反射、折射}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:1}", "$v = c/n$：水 \\qty{2.26e8}{m/s}，玻璃 \\qty{2.00e8}{m/s}，金刚石", "\\qty{1.24e8}{m/s}。光纤：$t = nL/c = 1.48 \\times 10^3/3.00\\times10^8 =", "\\qty{4.9}{\\micro s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:2}", "$\\sin i_2 = \\sin i_1/1.33$: $30^\\circ \\to 22.1^\\circ$; $60^\\circ \\to", "40.6^\\circ$。从水中以 $50^\\circ$ 入射：$1.33\\sin 50^\\circ = 1.02 > 1$，", "没有折射光线——发生全反射（$i_c = 48.8^\\circ$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:3}", "$i_c = \\arcsin(1/n)$：玻璃 $41.8^\\circ$，金刚石 $24.4^\\circ$，水", "$48.8^\\circ$。天空圆盘的张角为 $2 \\times 48.8^\\circ = 97.5^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:4}", "眼睛位于 \\qty{1.60}{m} 高处。从脚部发出的光线", "于眼高一半处（即 \\qty{0.80}{m}）反射后到达眼睛；从头顶发出的光线", "在头顶与眼睛的中点处反射，反射点高度为 \\qty{1.65}{m}。", "镜子从 \\qty{0.80}{m} 延伸到 \\qty{1.65}{m}：高度为 \\qty{0.85}{m}，恰为", "身高的一半——与距离无关（中点规则", "在任何距离下都成立）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:5}", "小角度近似下，从光疏介质中观察时视位置为 $h' = h/n$，", "从光密介质中观察时为 $h' = nh$。硬币：$1.2/1.33 =", "\\qty{0.90}{m}$。渔夫：$1.33 \\times 1.8 = \\qty{2.4}{m}$。理由如下：", "对于界面上水平距离为 $x$ 的点，$\\tan i_2 \\approx i_2 =", "x/h$，$\\tan i_1 \\approx i_1 = x/h'$，且 $i_1 = n i_2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:6}", "$\\sin\\frac{A + D_{\\min}}{2} = 1.52\\sin 30^\\circ = 0.760$，于是", "$\\frac{A + D_{\\min}}{2} = 49.5^\\circ$, $D_{\\min} = 38.9^\\circ$.", "出射需要 $r' \\leq i_c$；又由 $\\sin r = \\sin i/n \\leq 1/n$ 可得", "$r \\leq i_c$，因此 $A = r + r' \\leq 2i_c$。此处 $i_c = \\arcsin(1/1.52) =", "41.1^\\circ$，$2i_c = 82.3^\\circ > 60^\\circ$：成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:7}", "$\\mathrm{NA} = \\sqrt{1.50^2 - 1.48^2} = \\sqrt{0.0596} = 0.244$,", "$\\theta_a = 14.1^\\circ$. $\\Delta t/L = (1.50/c)(1.50/1.48 - 1) =", "5.0\\times10^{-9} \\times 0.0135 = \\qty{68}{ns/km}$。在 \\qty{1}{km} 范围内：", "$B_{\\max} \\approx 1/(2 \\times \\qty{68}{ns}) = \\qty{7.4}{Mbit/s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:8}", "$D \\approx (n - 1)A$：红光 $0.510 \\times 10^\\circ = 5.10^\\circ$，蓝光", "$5.30^\\circ$；光谱宽度为 $0.20^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:9}", "进入时：$\\sin r = \\sin 45^\\circ/1.5 = 0.471$，$r = 28.1^\\circ$。两个", "界面平行，因此在第二个界面上的入射角为 $r$，且", "$\\sin i' = n\\sin r = \\sin i$：$i' = i$，出射光线", "与入射光线平行。沿长为 $e/\\cos r$ 的内部路径，", "垂直方向的偏移为 $(e/\\cos r)\\sin(i - r)$：", "$d = 2.0 \\times \\sin 16.9^\\circ/\\cos 28.1^\\circ = \\qty{0.66}{cm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:10}", "两次折射（$2(i - r)$）和两次反射（$2(\\pi - 2r)$）：", "$D = 2\\pi + 2i - 6r$。$\\dd D/\\dd i = 2 - 6\\cos i/(n\\cos r) = 0$ 给出", "$3\\cos i = n\\cos r$, $9\\cos^2 i = n^2 - 1 + \\cos^2 i$, $\\cos^2 i =", "(n^2 - 1)/8$. $n = 1.333$: $\\cos^2 i = 0.0971$, $i = 71.8^\\circ$,", "$\\sin r = 0.950/1.333$, $r = 45.5^\\circ$, $D = 360^\\circ + 143.7^\\circ -", "272.8^\\circ = 230.9^\\circ$：虹位于距反日点 $230.9^\\circ - 180^\\circ =", "51^\\circ$ 处，在主虹（$42^\\circ$）之外。", "红光（$n = 1.331$）位于 $50.4^\\circ$，紫光（$1.343$）位于 $53.6^\\circ$：", "颜色顺序颠倒，紫光在外侧。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:11}", "$\\sin i_c = 1.00026/1.00029 = 0.99997$，$i_c = 89.56^\\circ$：光线", "与路面的夹角在 $0.44^\\circ = \\qty{7.7}{mrad}$ 以内的光线会被全", "反射（一般地，掠射角 $\\approx \\sqrt{2\\Delta n/n}$）。从", "\\qty{1.2}{m} 高处看去，视线在超过", "$1.2/0.0077 \\approx \\qty{160}{m}$ 的距离处以此角度掠射：那里的路面反射天空——", "即“水洼”。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:12}", "$t(x) = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{a^2 + x^2}}{v_1} + \\dfrac{\\sqrt{b^2 + (d - x)^2}}{v_2}$;", "$t'(x) = \\dfrac{x}{v_1\\sqrt{a^2 + x^2}} - \\dfrac{d - x}{v_2\\sqrt{b^2 + (d - x)^2}}", "= \\dfrac{\\sin i_1}{v_1} - \\dfrac{\\sin i_2}{v_2}$ 为零，当且仅当", "$\\sin i_1/v_1 = \\sin i_2/v_2$，即 $n_1\\sin i_1 = n_2\\sin i_2$，其中", "$n = c/v$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:rays-reflection-refraction:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $n = c/v$; $v_1 = 3.00\\times10^8/1.480 = \\qty{2.03e8}{m/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $t = Ln_1/c = 5.0\\times10^4 \\times 1.48/3.00\\times10^8 =", "\\qty{247}{\\micro s}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\nu = c/\\lambda_0 = \\qty{1.94e14}{Hz}$，在玻璃中保持不变；", "$\\lambda = \\lambda_0/n_1 = \\qty{1047}{nm}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} 裸露的纤芯只有在表面", "完全干净、未被触碰时才能导光：灰尘、水或手握处会局部以更高折射率的物质取代空气，", "使光线泄漏；划痕则会散射光线。包层", "是一个密封、可控的界面，其折射率阶跃是经过刻意选择的。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\sin i_c = 1.465/1.480 = 0.9899$, $i_c = 81.8^\\circ$.", ""]}